#A page is plain text, with these exceptions.
#
# *	A blank line begins a new paragraph.
# *	A paragraph of capital letters alone is a section heading.
# *	A line beginning with * begins an item of a bulleted list.
# *	A line beginning with ! is set in a fixed-width font as it is,
#	uninterpreted: for program listings and typescripts.
# *	Text in square brackets is a link: [the title of a page] (in any
#	case), [https://example.com], or [text | https://example.com].
#	A link is to a page of this wiki or to an http, https, ftp, mailto,
#	telnet or file URL; any other is shown as its text.
#
#HTML is not taken: what is written is shown as it is written, so a page
#reads as well in a text editor as in a browser.
#
